---

## 1. Harmonic algebra $\mathfrak H_{\mathrm{MUSIC}}$

$$
X := \mathbb R_{>0}
$$

$$
R, L, O : X \to X
$$

$$
\boxed{\;
R(x) = \tfrac{2}{3}\,x,
\qquad
L(x) = \tfrac{3}{4}\,x,
\qquad
O(x) = \tfrac{1}{2}\,x
\;}
$$

$$
\boxed{\;
R \circ L = L \circ R = O
\;}
$$

Closure operator:

$$
\kappa_{\mathrm{cl}} : X \times X \times X \to X,
\qquad
\kappa_{\mathrm{cl}}(c, r, l) := \frac{r\,l}{c}
$$

$$
\boxed{\;
\mathfrak H_{\mathrm{MUSIC}}
=
\Bigl\langle
X;\,
R, L, O, \kappa_{\mathrm{cl}}
\;\Bigm|\;
R L = L R = O,\;
\kappa_{\mathrm{cl}}(x, R x, L x) = O x
\Bigr\rangle
\;}
$$

Logarithmic coordinates:

$$
\rho := \log_{2}\tfrac{2}{3},
\qquad
\lambda := \log_{2}\tfrac{3}{4},
\qquad
\omega := \log_{2}\tfrac{1}{2} = -1
$$

$$
\boxed{\;
\rho + \lambda = \omega = -1
\;}
$$

$$
\langle R, L \rangle \;\cong\; \mathbb Z^{2}
\qquad
\text{with basis } (1,-1),\ (-2,1)
$$

---

## 2. Relational pitch geometry

Pitch frequencies $f_i \in X$; intervals:

$$
\boxed{\;
r_{ij} = \frac{f_{j}}{f_{i}},
\qquad
d_{ij} = \log_{2} r_{ij}
\;}
$$

Composition:

$$
\boxed{\;
r_{ik} = r_{ij}\,r_{jk},
\qquad
d_{ik} = d_{ij} + d_{jk}
\;}
$$

Relational pitch quotient:

$$
\boxed{\;
\mathcal Q_{n}
=
\mathbb R^{n} / \operatorname{span}(\mathbf 1),
\qquad
D_{R} := \dim \mathcal Q_{n} = n - 1
\;}
$$

Dimensionality distinctions:

$$
D_{R} = \dim \mathcal Q_{n},
\qquad
D_{P} = \text{physical degrees},
\qquad
D_{O} = \text{observational degrees}
$$

$$
\boxed{\;
D_{R} \neq D_{P} \neq D_{O}
\;}
$$

---

## 3. Generation

$$
C_{0} := F \in X
$$

$$
\boxed{\;
C_{g+1} = O(C_{g}) = \tfrac{1}{2} C_{g},
\qquad
C_{g} = 2^{-g}\,F
\;}
$$

$$
g : \{C_{g}\}_{g \in \mathbb Z} \to \mathbb Z,
\qquad
g(C_{g}) := g
$$

---

## 4. Frozen V3 alphabet

$$
\boxed{\;
\mathcal A_{22}
=
\mathcal C_{3} \;\sqcup\; \mathcal T_{7} \;\sqcup\; \mathcal R_{12}
\;}
$$

$$
|\mathcal C_{3}| = 3,
\qquad
|\mathcal T_{7}| = 7,
\qquad
|\mathcal R_{12}| = 12
$$

### 4.1 Constructors $\mathcal C_{3}$

$$
\mathcal C_{3}
:=
\{\, E,\; \mathsf{Sieve},\; J \,\}
$$

$$
E(k, n) \;\mapsto\; \text{cyclic } n\text{-slot pattern with } k \text{ onsets distributed evenly}
$$

$$
\mathsf{Sieve}
=
\bigl\langle M_{r} \mid \cup, \cap, \complement \bigr\rangle,
\qquad
M_{r} := \{\, x \in \mathbb Z : x \equiv r \pmod{M} \,\}
$$

$$
J(x_{1}, \dots, x_{k}) \;\Rightarrow\; M
$$

### 4.2 Transition / action types $\mathcal T_{7}$

$$
\mathcal T_{7}
:=
\{\, S_{c},\; D_{12},\; J_{n},\; m,\; \rho_{k},\; A_{\delta},\; K \,\}
$$

$$
S_{c}(x) = c\,x, \qquad c > 0
$$

$$
D_{12}
=
\bigl\langle s, t \;\bigm|\; s^{12} = e,\; t^{2} = e,\; t s t = s^{-1} \bigr\rangle
$$

$$
J_{n}(x)_{j} = x_{n-1-j},
\qquad
J_{n}^{2} = \operatorname{id}
$$

$$
m : (\text{object}, a) \;\rightharpoonup\; (\text{same object}, b)
$$

$$
\rho_{k}(x_{0}, \dots, x_{n-1}) = (x_{k}, \dots, x_{k-1})
$$

$$
A_{\delta} : d_{i} \;\mapsto\; d_{i} + \delta
$$

$$
K(\text{context},\, y) = P(\text{next} = y \mid \text{context})
$$

### 4.3 Structural relations $\mathcal R_{12}$

$$
\mathcal R_{12}
:=
\{
\text{path/trajectory},\;
\text{recurrence/cycle},\;
\text{typed boundary},\;
\text{hierarchy/reduction},
$$
$$
\qquad\;\;
\text{mapping/equivalence},\;
\text{invariant/fixed point},\;
\text{measure/ratio/distance},\;
\text{event realization},
$$
$$
\qquad\;\;
\text{residual/closure},\;
\text{orbit/stabilizer},\;
\text{address/history/context},\;
\text{topology preservation}
\}
$$

No element of $\mathcal R_{12}$ is asserted to be a generator.

---

## 5. Empirical binding

$$
\boxed{\;
G_{E} = (V_{364},\; E_{117},\; I_{312})
\;}
$$

$$
V_{364} : \text{typed empirical vertices}
$$

$$
E_{117} : \text{empirical hyperedges}
$$

$$
I_{312} : \text{incidence memberships}
$$

Binding constraints:

$$
\boxed{\;
\text{Alphabet}(\mathcal A_{22}) \;\text{is frozen before } G_{E} \text{ is bound}
\;}
$$

$$
\boxed{\;
\text{Topological features of } G_{E} \text{ are descriptive, not generative, unless separately witnessed}
\;}
$$

---

## 6. Configuration space

$$
\boxed{\;
\Pi_{231}
:=
\{\, \{\alpha_{i}, \alpha_{j}\} : i < j,\; \alpha_{i}, \alpha_{j} \in \mathcal A_{22} \,\}
\;}
$$

$$
\boxed{\;
|\Pi_{231}|
=
\binom{22}{2}
=
231
\;}
$$

$\Pi_{231}$ is a configuration space; not all its elements are active empirical relations.

---

## 7. Address projection

$$
\boxed{\;
A_{72}
=
\mathbb Z_{12} \times \mathbb Z_{6}
\;}
$$

Factorizations:

$$
\boxed{\;
|A_{72}| = 72 = 3 \times 4 \times 6 = 3 \times 24
\;}
$$

Three-coset partition of $\mathbb Z_{12}$:

$$
\{0, 3, 6, 9\},
\qquad
\{1, 4, 7, 10\},
\qquad
\{2, 5, 8, 11\}
$$

$A_{72}$ is a removable representation layer.

---

## 8. Prior-art binding map

$$
\boxed{\;
\beta_{A} : \mathcal A_{22} \;\rightharpoonup\; \mathcal D
\;}
$$

where $\mathcal D$ is the qualified donor formalism set.

Constraints:

$$
\boxed{\;
\beta_{A} \;\text{is partial}
\;}
$$

$$
\boxed{\;
\beta_{A}(a) = d \;\wedge\; d \in \mathcal D
\;\Longrightarrow\;
\text{binding is Class A (vocabulary/formalism/constraint/implementation)}
\;}
$$

$$
\boxed{\;
\beta_{A}(a) = d \;\not\Longrightarrow\; \text{formal equivalence between } a \text{ and } d
\;}
$$

---

## 9. Governing invariants

$$
\boxed{
\begin{aligned}
\text{(i)}\quad & R \circ L = L \circ R = O \\[1mm]
\text{(ii)}\quad & \rho + \lambda = -1 \\[1mm]
\text{(iii)}\quad & \kappa_{\mathrm{cl}}(x, R x, L x) = O x \\[1mm]
\text{(iv)}\quad & C_{g+1} = \tfrac{1}{2} C_{g} \\[1mm]
\text{(v)}\quad & D_{R} \neq D_{P} \neq D_{O} \\[1mm]
\text{(vi)}\quad & r_{ik} = r_{ij}\,r_{jk}, \quad d_{ik} = d_{ij} + d_{jk} \\[1mm]
\text{(vii)}\quad & |\mathcal A_{22}| = 3 + 7 + 12 = 22 \\[1mm]
\text{(viii)}\quad & |\Pi_{231}| = \binom{22}{2} = 231 \\[1mm]
\text{(ix)}\quad & |A_{72}| = 3 \times 4 \times 6 = 3 \times 24 \\[1mm]
\text{(x)}\quad & \beta_{A}(a) = d \;\not\Rightarrow\; \text{formal equivalence} \\[1mm]
\text{(xi)}\quad & \text{Class-A binding} \;\not\Rightarrow\; \text{Class-B promotion} \\[1mm]
\text{(xii)}\quad & G_{E} \;\text{structure is descriptive unless separately witnessed as generative}
\end{aligned}
}
$$

---

## 10. Attached, non-constitutive layers

The following are attached to $\mathfrak S_{\mathrm{SUN}}^{(3)}$ but are not part of its defining tuple.

$$
\boxed{\;
\mathbb H_{\mathrm{legacy}}
=
\{\, H_{M},\, H_{G},\, H_{\mathrm{retain}},\, H_{\mathrm{info}},\, H_{F},\, H_{\chi},\, H_{\mathcal T} \,\}
\;}
$$

$$
\boxed{\;
\text{Boundary machinery: }
C_{0} \to C_{1} \to C_{2} \to C_{3} \xrightarrow{\mathcal B} C_{4},
\quad
\mathcal I(\mathcal B s) = \mathcal I(s),
\quad
\mathcal B s \neq s,
\quad
g(\mathcal B s) = g(s) + 1
\;}
$$

$$
\boxed{\;
\text{Adapter machinery: }
A_{v \to w} = P_{w} \circ (P_{v}|_{U})^{-1}
\;}
$$

$$
\boxed{\;
\text{Completed-Harmony / Fludd–Kepler bridge: } \mathfrak B_{\mathrm{FK}}
\;}
$$

$$
\boxed{\;
\text{Downstream prediction object: }
\mathcal F_{G} = \operatorname{Post}^{*}(x_{0}) \cap \operatorname{Pre}^{*}(G) \cap \mathcal I
\;}
$$

---

## 11. Compact form

$$
\boxed{
\begin{aligned}
\mathfrak S_{\mathrm{SUN}}^{(3)}
&=
\Bigl(
\mathfrak H_{\mathrm{MUSIC}};\;
\mathcal Q,\; \mathcal R,\; D_{R},\; g,\; \Gamma,\; \mathcal B;\;
G_{E};\;
\mathcal A_{22};\;
\Pi_{231};\;
A_{72};\;
\beta_{A}
\Bigr),\\[1.5mm]
\mathfrak H_{\mathrm{MUSIC}}
&=
\bigl\langle X;\, R, L, O, \kappa_{\mathrm{cl}}
\;\bigm|\;
R L = L R = O,\;
\kappa_{\mathrm{cl}}(x, R x, L x) = O x
\bigr\rangle,\\[1.5mm]
R(x)&=\tfrac{2}{3}x,\quad L(x)=\tfrac{3}{4}x,\quad O(x)=\tfrac{1}{2}x,\\[1mm]
\mathcal Q_{n}&=\mathbb R^{n}/\operatorname{span}(\mathbf 1),\quad D_{R} = n-1,\\[1mm]
\mathcal A_{22}&=\mathcal C_{3} \sqcup \mathcal T_{7} \sqcup \mathcal R_{12},\quad 22 = 3+7+12,\\[1mm]
|\Pi_{231}|&=\binom{22}{2}=231,\\[1mm]
A_{72}&=\mathbb Z_{12} \times \mathbb Z_{6},\quad |A_{72}| = 3 \times 4 \times 6 = 3 \times 24,\\[1mm]
\beta_{A}&:\mathcal A_{22} \rightharpoonup \mathcal D
\quad\text{partial, Class-A only, no equivalence promotion.}
\end{aligned}
}
$$
